71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6KXSJT5sUpkQ7kNvwE1b0KX&_nc_oc=AdqmaFINEx0Rirx5Dxq6GOTj_EimhJ94RKXs933wH_dSovpOjg0y_dXhe-faK082p2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJg6-2IMFar50HJg8ZZLwGHkuh0E7a2GvGj4eXKSPufdQ&oe=6AABE6B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MAYprMiWnbkQ7kNvwHzmXCH&_nc_oc=AdqmLce4D6VaV663wvQx8K8ds5ffraUImeFKXOTTVvDnTWNzOwRA7mtU5DOI-CBZK1Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJzjiaklZ18Bz0NoOhvPfDmkOT-0rcqK1XuLxnf248p9A&oe=6AABF993"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gQywFOKisgkQ7kNvwEobCHT&_nc_oc=AdowVhOY0ii4SThRGFrZ97iB3_yGU3JuZ-yMnoUoxA7ZTsMvy74SwCDInglPMX5GLUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI91xjvL3tWA_lHBJsqnDxiZ3hGaAwpeMY6JOy_h3C03g&oe=6AABF7DA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: